383
00:26:34,737 --> 00:26:37,552
- Quem perder, lava a louça?
- Fechado.

384
00:26:39,742 --> 00:26:42,557
<i>Culpepper dribla Williams.
Vai arremessar...</i>

385
00:26:42,661 --> 00:26:45,790
